    {
      "stage": "ground",
      "path": "variants",
      "message": "applied variant {\"isPartToWhole\":true} — Measured: electricity-mix-area puts y on the right, seattle-range does not. Both are area marks, so markChannel cannot separate them; isPartToWhole can. On a pie the policy is inert."
    },
